		c	{@return the registry key of this entry}\n\n@throws IllegalStateException if this is an intrusive entry and it is not initialized yet
	m	(Lnet/minecraft/class_7876;Ljava/lang/Object;)Lnet/minecraft/class_6880$class_6883;	method_40233	intrusive
		c	{@return a new intrusive registry entry}\n\n<p>This should not be called manually. Call {@link net.minecraft.registry.Registry#entryOf} or\n{@link net.minecraft.registry.Registry#getEntry} instead.\n\n<p>Callers are responsible for filling the key later by calling {@link\n#setRegistryKey}.\n\n@deprecated Intrusive holders exist for legacy reasons only.
